{"4278870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Strange Finds", "steam_appid": 4278870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand years ago, the legendary<strong> </strong>island of<strong> Mantas</strong> was lost to history. Today, you and your excavation team are digging on a tiny island where a shepherd has found some pottery... but you’re about to find something incredible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7ac3e344e3b2eecb2581e7ca5d8ca504.avif?t=1781645006\" width=1108 height=572 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRANGE FINDS</strong> is an adventure game  inspired by the principles of real archaeology. Explore a forgotten chapter of a Bronze Age Mediterranean-inspired fantasy world, and work with your eccentric team of modern specialists to piece together the timeline of a lost civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's how it goes:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/521912975b48c47bc2a280c598a97710.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/fbb1ae2878ccfc3f3d8dc41d9a7cfa06.poster.avif?t=1781645006\" width=720 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/fbb1ae2878ccfc3f3d8dc41d9a7cfa06.webm?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/fbb1ae2878ccfc3f3d8dc41d9a7cfa06.mp4?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get out your pickaxe and <strong>dig up</strong> <strong>the ancient</strong> <strong>ruins</strong> of the island, one room at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>uncover</strong> statues, sacred offerings, dirt middens full of trace materials, and pottery (there's a lot of pottery).  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've finished excavating, the left-hand panel of your screen moves into play. It's time for...  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/e5f0470856110778e80e014460483814.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7d88cf835e074a42b12cfee76517efae.poster.avif?t=1781645006\" width=720 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7d88cf835e074a42b12cfee76517efae.webm?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7d88cf835e074a42b12cfee76517efae.mp4?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign your finds</strong> to specialists on your team to scrub them clean or put them under a microscope. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the dirt falls away, you'll <strong>get the</strong> <strong>true form</strong> of each object you've uncovered, and some notes about each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some finds might <strong>fit together</strong> into larger pieces, which can offer new insights into the culture of the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When your finds have all been processed, the right-hand panel of your screen moves into play. It's time for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/22aa4056fff5bae4e5eff7f1be3e357e.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/3ecc94f8d918009d6369a5c72951fe76.poster.avif?t=1781645006\" width=720 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/3ecc94f8d918009d6369a5c72951fe76.webm?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/3ecc94f8d918009d6369a5c72951fe76.mp4?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You brought some research questions to the island with you, didn't you? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble</strong> <strong>sequences</strong> of your finds to form the answers to these questions, establishing new facts about the island's ancient history in the process. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Present</strong> <strong>your answers</strong> to your highly skilled but physically exhausted and quite sweaty team of specialists to get their thoughts on things, resulting in new research questions to complete. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the years progress</strong>, you'll also draw on finds from other sites, museum collections, and parallel excavations  to shed new light on the Dark Age of the Archipelago. Who knows what else you'll find out there?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/6090f1a3ee1997a180b73e1f5b7818b1.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a 3D artist,  one-time archaeologist, and second-generation Greek American based in NYC. This game is the product of my lifelong love of Greek culture, the ancient mythologies of the Eastern Mediterranean, and the muddy history of archaeology as a discipline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've worked on critically-acclaimed small indie titles in both educational and commercial games. This is my first attempt to use videogames to make obscure historical material accessible and engaging. I'm very excited to share this labor of love with you all, and I'm humbled by the support my efforts have already received. Hope you enjoy the game! 🧿🧿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks in advance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demetri</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please wishlist and follow STRANGE FINDS for the latest updates on the game's development!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand years ago, the legendary<strong> </strong>island of<strong> Mantas</strong> was lost to history. Today, you and your excavation team are digging on a tiny island where a shepherd has found some pottery... but you’re about to find something incredible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7ac3e344e3b2eecb2581e7ca5d8ca504.avif?t=1781645006\" width=1108 height=572 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRANGE FINDS</strong> is an adventure game  inspired by the principles of real archaeology. Explore a forgotten chapter of a Bronze Age Mediterranean-inspired fantasy world, and work with your eccentric team of modern specialists to piece together the timeline of a lost civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's how it goes:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/521912975b48c47bc2a280c598a97710.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/fbb1ae2878ccfc3f3d8dc41d9a7cfa06.poster.avif?t=1781645006\" width=720 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/fbb1ae2878ccfc3f3d8dc41d9a7cfa06.webm?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/fbb1ae2878ccfc3f3d8dc41d9a7cfa06.mp4?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get out your pickaxe and <strong>dig up</strong> <strong>the ancient</strong> <strong>ruins</strong> of the island, one room at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>uncover</strong> statues, sacred offerings, dirt middens full of trace materials, and pottery (there's a lot of pottery).  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've finished excavating, the left-hand panel of your screen moves into play. It's time for...  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/e5f0470856110778e80e014460483814.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7d88cf835e074a42b12cfee76517efae.poster.avif?t=1781645006\" width=720 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7d88cf835e074a42b12cfee76517efae.webm?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/7d88cf835e074a42b12cfee76517efae.mp4?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign your finds</strong> to specialists on your team to scrub them clean or put them under a microscope. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the dirt falls away, you'll <strong>get the</strong> <strong>true form</strong> of each object you've uncovered, and some notes about each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some finds might <strong>fit together</strong> into larger pieces, which can offer new insights into the culture of the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When your finds have all been processed, the right-hand panel of your screen moves into play. It's time for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/22aa4056fff5bae4e5eff7f1be3e357e.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/3ecc94f8d918009d6369a5c72951fe76.poster.avif?t=1781645006\" width=720 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/3ecc94f8d918009d6369a5c72951fe76.webm?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/3ecc94f8d918009d6369a5c72951fe76.mp4?t=1781645006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You brought some research questions to the island with you, didn't you? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble</strong> <strong>sequences</strong> of your finds to form the answers to these questions, establishing new facts about the island's ancient history in the process. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Present</strong> <strong>your answers</strong> to your highly skilled but physically exhausted and quite sweaty team of specialists to get their thoughts on things, resulting in new research questions to complete. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the years progress</strong>, you'll also draw on finds from other sites, museum collections, and parallel excavations  to shed new light on the Dark Age of the Archipelago. Who knows what else you'll find out there?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/extras/6090f1a3ee1997a180b73e1f5b7818b1.avif?t=1781645006\" width=986 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a 3D artist,  one-time archaeologist, and second-generation Greek American based in NYC. This game is the product of my lifelong love of Greek culture, the ancient mythologies of the Eastern Mediterranean, and the muddy history of archaeology as a discipline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've worked on critically-acclaimed small indie titles in both educational and commercial games. This is my first attempt to use videogames to make obscure historical material accessible and engaging. I'm very excited to share this labor of love with you all, and I'm humbled by the support my efforts have already received. Hope you enjoy the game! 🧿🧿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks in advance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demetri</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please wishlist and follow STRANGE FINDS for the latest updates on the game's development!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Discover the ancient Archipelago as the director of the archaeological excavation of the century. Dig up ruins, restore your finds, and answer research questions to piece together the timeline of a lost civilization.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/a10e3131a33ba0b67ab1d1bb2f213d2e0ba6ba67/header.jpg?t=1781645006", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/e000e43f24084e422d8c78f8223c14c4f1d023f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781645006", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/e000e43f24084e422d8c78f8223c14c4f1d023f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781645006", "website": "https://lordofhandsstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Lord of Hands Studio"], "publishers": ["Lord of Hands Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 4390620, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/af8834f9748a943cc472a81a44650b31ccdf3ef3/ss_af8834f9748a943cc472a81a44650b31ccdf3ef3.600x338.jpg?t=1781645006", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/af8834f9748a943cc472a81a44650b31ccdf3ef3/ss_af8834f9748a943cc472a81a44650b31ccdf3ef3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781645006"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/b940de1026910f09348637bb917a1d02ec1c3aa5/ss_b940de1026910f09348637bb917a1d02ec1c3aa5.600x338.jpg?t=1781645006", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/b940de1026910f09348637bb917a1d02ec1c3aa5/ss_b940de1026910f09348637bb917a1d02ec1c3aa5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781645006"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/4f2d5cc6dd3612097eb7db497409f83b288ca0af/ss_4f2d5cc6dd3612097eb7db497409f83b288ca0af.600x338.jpg?t=1781645006", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/4f2d5cc6dd3612097eb7db497409f83b288ca0af/ss_4f2d5cc6dd3612097eb7db497409f83b288ca0af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781645006"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/7f9450b3a6344b0a403e69b7b3b39b7faac3b8c9/ss_7f9450b3a6344b0a403e69b7b3b39b7faac3b8c9.600x338.jpg?t=1781645006", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/7f9450b3a6344b0a403e69b7b3b39b7faac3b8c9/ss_7f9450b3a6344b0a403e69b7b3b39b7faac3b8c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781645006"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/665b5918620abb6432c3b90d21318f501659eb9b/ss_665b5918620abb6432c3b90d21318f501659eb9b.600x338.jpg?t=1781645006", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278870/66